Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Fifth Episode\NThe Ghost Ship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Has the ghost ship attacked again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's already the sixth ship to sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What could this ghost ship be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A sailor who survived\Nthe shipwreck reported...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...that the ghost ship was\Ncommanded by a legendary character!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary? And who would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d never guess! The\Nfamous Captain Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood?!\NDon't tell me that Captain Blood..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,. ...is sinking Silverland's ships!\N- Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We even have eyewitnesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak! Is it true that you saw\NCaptain Blood on that ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, sir, with our own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood has\Nhelped me so many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought he was a\Ngenerous man, even if a bit rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope those sailors were mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! I think something is\Nwrong with him. He looks so depressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?\NWhat were you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,About something that needs\Nto be verified first. Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at those beautiful ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now he's going to look for Blood.\N- Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's his ship, I recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange... there's\Nnot a living soul on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Captain Blood!\N- Hello, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognized your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't there a sentry?\NIt could be dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- So I didn't set a\Nsentry? Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What was that, boatswain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nothing serious, I slipped\Non the rail and fell into the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- The boatswain has\Nbeen replaced, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret of the ghost ship\Nwon't be easily discovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Better that way, because otherwise\Nwe would receive a severe reprimand..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,. from Mr. X.\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- There is really nothing to\Nlaugh about, Captain Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- But Sapphire, how\Ncould I calmly frequent..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,. the port of your Kingdom\Nif mine were the ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- And yet there are\Nsailors who can testify.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore you could be\Narrested at any moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't think that would\Nbe possible anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship has set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!\NI really didn't expect this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two! Ready a new\Nlifeboat for my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir! - A lifeboat?\N- Prepare the sturdiest one
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...so they can reach the port\Nsafe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going back to land!\NWe will find the ghost ship
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can prove\Nyour innocence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse your offer!\NThe sea belongs only to men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...and a woman profanes it!\NCrew, am I not right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes! Of course! It's true!\N- What a backwards mentality!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anyway, I'm not going back home!\N- You must obey my order!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I refuse\Nand I beg you not to insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Princess,\Nas you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't complain,\NI warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on me! I'll work better\Nthan anyone else on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you all hear that?\NShow no special treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You will treat her\Nlike a member of the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boys, it's your\Nfirst job! Wash these clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not telling me that\Nwe have to wash them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course! And then you'll sweep the deck!\N- Fine. And after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare some food,\Nclean the masts...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!\NGet out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say\Nthere was to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean the mainmast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What delicacies! What treats!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, this girl\Nis truly to be admired!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She cooks well and she works\Nwell. She's a respectable sailor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. In my life\NI have never seen a sailor..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...so good and scrupulous\Nat doing his duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see nothing but sea!\NWe've been sailing for many days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland is very far away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Dad\Nand Mom are doing, if they are thinking of me..!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they'll be thinking of you!\NThey'll be worried, in fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have worked well. It seems as if\Nthey have assisted you with their thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any manners?\NYou must knock before entering!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, but you were immersed\Nin your thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you didn't notice!\N- Listen, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come\Nto search for the ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I will do.\NAnd as soon as I've found it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take the necessary measures\Nso that it can no longer do harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- The ghost ship is in sight!\N- There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go see, quick!\N- There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We would do well to get closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's dangerous!\NBetter to approach with a boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Prepare a lifeboat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go take possession\Nof the ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurrah!\N- Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid! It's\Nthe electricity in the air...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...clinging to the ship's masts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no one there, say no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Found anything strange?\N- No, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It just seems like an abandoned ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's head back on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, something doesn't feel right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.66,0:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are the\Nship's boatswain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, brat,\NI’m only his substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know\Nthe secret of this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we cannot let you go.\NCome out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry,\Nwe’ll keep you with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re coming to Hell Island,\Nwhere we live!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To Hell Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at once\Nor we’re leaving without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Tink?\NWhere did he get to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he’s on the lifeboat\Nthat left earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I searched the ship from top\Nto bottom, but I didn’t see a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the search,\Nbut now let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a trap! Watch out!\NTake cover, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- The ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's save ourselves!\N- Quick, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's run! Help!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the mainsail!\NHard to starboard! Ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, ready: fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for the powder magazine!\NFire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Old sailor..!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my last wish,\NSapphire:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sink the ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn you, ghost ship!\N- Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- It hit the powder magazine!\N- Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Captain, you're great!\N- Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- The ship has turned about!\N- Let's chase it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! It's getting away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't end here, I'll\Nmake you pay, ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the rum you liked\Nso much. And it's top-shelf!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, old man!\NWe'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you not spotted\Nthe ghost ship yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I only see\Na seagull flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! A letter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was captured\Nby a ghost ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And taken to an island\Ncalled Hell Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a terrifying place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many men with many weapons\Nstanding guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a shark\Ncan get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Any ship that enters the bay\Nis destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this letter\Nis read by Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Try the batteries\Nof the ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You must reach the ship\Nwhere Sapphire is on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:16:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So their base\Nwould be Hell Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you know it?\N- Of course I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's surrounded\Nby steep cliffs..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...and has only one inlet\Nthat allows ships to dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an ideal place to hide
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's something else!\NIt says the boatswain is a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!\NHow can he say these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the boatswain himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will always be grateful to you, Sapphire,\Nyou saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell Island\Nis a volcanic island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The water around the island\Nis so hot that it boils!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One side of the island\Nis a very steep cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We will attack there\Nand surprise them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That way we will penetrate their lair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Sapphire! Hold onto me\Nor you'll end up overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashore, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.98,0:18:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, there's a sentry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet or he'll notice us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your help, the ghost\Noperation is going perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is only the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight we drink to\Ncelebrate our next conquest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can attack as long\Nas we stay on this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look,\Na party of ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take them all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My brave men, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!\NTake this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, chase him!\NDon't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will annihilate you, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss has been killed! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, boys!\NGive them no rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we are winning!\NIt's a great victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally! You have the proof of my innocence, Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, I have the proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Tink!\NThanks to your letter..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...we have avenged the shipwrecked sailors!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Captain Blood?\NNothing serious, I hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, you know that I am immortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you two will return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My men will accompany you with the ghost ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Captain, I am worried about this wound! It must be treated!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trifle! I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, you must hurry to set sail for Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,where you will have to face the enemies of your Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Captain...!\N- Go away, please! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault they wounded him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.42,0:22:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.02,0:22:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye, Princess!\N- Bye, Tink! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- How do you feel, Captain?\N- I can make it, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye and see you soon, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He is very kind and so generous!
